This file credits the sources the plugin learned from.


1. Method

Collected from books by various authors, retold in our own words; no text from
them is reproduced.


2. AI-tell pattern ideas (skills/writer/data/slop/*.json)

From the sources below we took only ideas: which phrases signal
machine-written text, and regular expressions for them (facts, not text).
Hints and examples are written anew; no wording, before/after example or code
was copied. Severity levels are our own.

- humanizer, https://github.com/blader/humanizer - Siqi Chen (GitHub: blader). MIT License.
- humanizer-ru, https://skills.sh/smixs/humanizer-ru - Serge Shima. MIT License.
- humanizer-ru, https://github.com/ilyautov/humanizer-ru - Ilya Utov. MIT License.
- humanizer-skill, https://github.com/Aboudjem/humanizer-skill - Adam Boudjemaa. MIT License.
- stop-slop, https://github.com/hardikpandya/stop-slop - Hardik Pandya. MIT License.
- no-ai-slop, https://github.com/petergyang/no-ai-slop - Peter Yang. MIT License.
